# Project 1 — Ubuntu Web Server

## 📌 Overview

I built and configured an Ubuntu Linux web server in my Proxmox home lab and deployed a custom webpage using Nginx.

This project is my first hands-on cloud engineering lab and focuses on Linux administration, networking, SSH, firewalls, web servers, and basic system monitoring.

## 🎯 Objectives

- Deploy an Ubuntu Linux server
- Configure remote SSH access
- Create a dedicated administrative user
- Configure a UFW firewall
- Install and configure Nginx
- Deploy a custom webpage
- Learn basic server monitoring
- Inspect web server logs

## 🖥️ Environment

- Virtualization: Proxmox
- Operating System: Ubuntu Server
- Web Server: Nginx
- Remote Access: SSH
- Firewall: UFW
- Network: Local home lab

## 🔐 Security Configuration

Created a dedicated administrative user:

`cloudadmin`

Configured firewall rules to allow:

- SSH
- HTTP
- HTTPS

Verified the firewall with:

```bash
sudo ufw status
